# Error messages. Codes and fix articles live in content/errors/errors.yaml (M1.9).

error-not-permitted = You don't have permission to do that.
error-role-lock-wrong-pin = That PIN didn't work. Try again.
error-role-lock-too-many-tries = Too many tries. Wait 30 seconds, then try again.
error-role-lock-pin-format = Use a PIN of 4 to 8 numbers.
error-unsupported-request = Selah couldn't do that. Try again, or restart Selah.
error-invalid-setting = That setting isn't allowed.
error-not-connected = Selah isn't connected yet. Wait a moment, then try again.
error-invalid-request = Selah couldn't read that request. Restart Selah if this keeps happening.
error-screen-not-connected = A screen is not connected. Check its cable, then try again.
error-screen-unplugged = A screen was unplugged. Plug it back in. Selah will use it again.
error-safe-mode = Selah started in safe mode. Some features are off.
error-help-not-found = Selah couldn't find that help article.
error-support-bundle = Selah couldn't save the support file. Check that your disk has space, then try again.
error-diagnostics-live = Something is on the screens. Clear them, then run the benchmark.
error-diagnostics-failed = The benchmark couldn't run. Restart Selah, then try again.
error-update-off = Update checks are off. Turn them on in Settings, then try again.
error-update-feed = Selah couldn't read the update address. Check the address and your internet, then try again.
error-update-verify = The update didn't download correctly, so Selah didn't install it. Try again later.
error-update-live = Something is on the screens. Clear them, then install the update.
error-update-install = Selah couldn't start the update. Try again, or install the new version from its Setup file.
error-library-not-found = Selah couldn't find that item in your library.
error-library-invalid = Selah couldn't save that change to your library. Check what you entered, then try again.
error-setting-locked = Your church admin locked this setting, so it can't change here.
error-nothing-to-undo = There is nothing left to undo or redo.

## Ready for Sunday (M4.7)
error-ready-media-missing = A file for { $item } is missing or changed.
error-ready-font-missing = { $item } uses the font { $font }, which isn't installed.
error-ready-text-doesnt-fit = The words of { $item } don't fit on { $output }.
error-ready-no-copyright = { $item } has no copyright line.
error-ready-no-ccli-licence = Your church's CCLI licence number isn't set.
error-ready-no-screens = No screens are connected.
error-ready-screen-not-showing = { $output } isn't showing anything.
error-ready-no-backup-sync = Backup sync isn't in Selah yet. Back up your library by hand.
error-ready-flashing = { $item } may flash too fast for some people.
error-ready-limiter-off = The volume limiter is off.
